    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 3 \u2014 Script\nGemini writes title, hook, 6 scenes.\nEdit text inside **3. Script prompt**.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 280,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "lw005",
      "name": "STEP 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        420,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "sys",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "value": "You are the content director and cinematographer for LOOP WORK.\n\nLOOP WORK sells: n8n automation, website design, digital marketing.\nAudience: small business owners. Faceless 9:16 Reel / YouTube Short only.\n\nLOOK LOCK (every AI still and AI clip must match):\n- Magic hour / golden hour only: warm sun, long shadows, amber rim light, teal shadows, cinematic haze\n- Photoreal, 35mm, shallow depth of field, anamorphic bokeh, premium tech brand\n- Dark teal + gold grade. No noon sun. No office fluorescent. No cartoon. No 3D render look\n- NEVER any readable text, UI, logos, watermarks, subtitles, captions, hands holding phones with screens of text\n\nVOICE:\n- Hook in sentence 1. No \"Hey guys\", no \"in this video\", no guru hype\n- Specific tools and numbers. 125-155 spoken words\n- Exactly 6 scenes. Concatenated scene narration MUST equal script\n\nVISUAL MIX (exact, do not change counts):\n1 pexels_video = hook energy, real stock motion\n2 ai_image = custom magic-hour stills (your look)\n1 pexels_photo = real stock still\n1 local = creator file, local_hint only\n1 ai_video = ONE short 4-5s motion clip, same magic-hour look\n\npexels_query = 3-6 real B-roll words. Examples: \"golden hour laptop window\", \"small business owner sunset office\", \"hands typing dusk\". Never brand names.\nai_prompt = one shot, one subject, magic hour, photoreal, vertical 9:16, no text. Start with: \"cinematic still, magic hour, golden rim light, teal shadows,\"\nai_video_prompt = same look + CAMERA MOVE only (slow push in, orbit, drone descend, parallax). 4 seconds. No dialogue. No text.\nimage_to_video_prompt = how to animate the matching ai_image: \"slow cinematic push in, locked look, subtle dust in sunbeams, no morphing, no extra objects\"\nlocal_hint = 2-3 words matching files like laptop, desk, website, phone\n\nReturn JSON only, no markdown:\n{\"title\":\"\",\"hook\":\"\",\"script\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"hashtags\":[\"loopwork\",\"automation\",\"n8n\"],\"youtube_description\":\"\",\"scenes\":[{\"id\":1,\"narration\":\"\",\"visual_type\":\"pexels_video\",\"pexels_query\":\"\",\"ai_prompt\":\"\",\"ai_video_prompt\":\"\",\"image_to_video_prompt\":\"\",\"local_hint\":\"\"}]}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "usr",
              "name": "userPrompt",
              "value": "={{ 'Channel: Loop Work. Format: 9:16 reel.\\nTopic: ' + ($json.Topic || 'pick the strongest topic today about automation, website design, or digital marketing') + '\\nNotes: ' + ($json.Notes || 'none') + '\\nReturn JSON only.' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "lw006",
      "name": "3. Script prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        460,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={ 'https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/' + $('2. Config').first().json.geminiModel + ':generateContent?key=' + $env.GEMINI_API_KEY }",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ systemInstruction: { parts: [{ text: $json.systemPrompt }] }, contents: [{ role: 'user', parts: [{ text: $json.userPrompt }] }], generationConfig: { temperature: 0.8, responseMimeType: 'application/json' } }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "lw007",
      "name": "3. Gemini write script",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        780,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "pack",
              "name": "pack",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.candidates[0].content.parts[0].text.replaceAll('```json','').replaceAll('```','').trim()) }}",
              "type": "object"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "lw008",
      "name": "4. Extract script pack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1100,
        240
